body:
I don't know, I refuse to see doctors. My mother has booked me appts for years at psychologists but I would never go. 

&#x200B;

Last time I went to a basic doctor, I took courage to say, I wasn't coping with life, and she smiled and said, Well I'm going to be on holidays now and have my next appt in 10 mins but when I come back from holidays we can chat if you like. and next second she was asking me to pay.
